    {
        "content": "<p>The expected type for the <code>LinearMap.IsScalarTower.compatibleSMul</code> call is</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"bp\">@</span><span class=\"n\">IsScalarTower</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">S</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">R</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">tsze</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">R</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">M</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">inst</span><span class=\"bp\">✝⁹.</span><span class=\"n\">toSMul</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">DistribMulAction</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toDistribSMul</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toSMul</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">smul</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>whereas <code>st</code> has type</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"bp\">@</span><span class=\"n\">IsScalarTower</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">S</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">R</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">tsze</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">R</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">M</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">inst</span><span class=\"bp\">✝⁹.</span><span class=\"n\">toSMul</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">smul</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">smul</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>But <code>synthInstance</code> tells nothing:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">Meta</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">synthInstance</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"