    {
        "content": "<p>Expanding the trace gives me the following:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Text only\"><pre><span></span><code>[Meta.synthInstance] 💥️ AddCommMonoid ?m.38 ▶\n[Meta.synthInstance] 💥️ AddCommMonoid ?m.39 ▶\n[Meta.synthInstance] 💥️ Semiring ?m.43 ▶\n[Meta.synthInstance] 💥️ SMul ?m.42 ?m.38 ▶\n[Meta.synthInstance] 💥️ Module ?m.43 ?m.38 ▶\n[Meta.synthInstance] 💥️ SMul ?m.42 ?m.39 ▶\n[Meta.synthInstance] 💥️ Module ?m.43 ?m.39 ▶\n[Meta.synthInstance] 💥️ SMul ?m.42 ?m.43 ▶\n[Meta.synthInstance] 💥️ IsScalarTower ?m.42 ?m.43 ?m.38 ▶\n[Meta.synthInstance] 💥️ IsScalarTower ?m.42 ?m.43 ?m.39 ▶\n[Meta.isDefEq] ✅️ LinearMap.CompatibleSMul M (tsze R M) S R =?= LinearMap.CompatibleSMul ?m.38 ?m.39 ?m.42 ?m.43 ▶\n[Meta.synthInstance] ✅️ AddCommMonoid M ▶\n[Meta.isDefEq] ✅️ inst✝¹⁰ =?= inst✝¹⁰\n[Meta.synthInstance] ✅️ AddCommMonoid (tsze R M) ▶\n[Meta.isDefEq] ✅️ addCommMonoid =?= addCommMonoid\n[Meta.synthInstance] ✅️ Semiring R ▶\n[Meta.isDefEq] ✅️ inst✝¹² =?= inst✝¹²\n[Meta.synthInstance] ✅️ SMul S M ▶\n[Meta.isDefEq] ✅️ DistribMulAction.toDistribSMul.toSMul =?= DistribMulAction.toDistribSMul.toSMul\n[Meta.synthInstance] ✅️ Module R M ▶\n[Meta.isDefEq] ✅️ inst✝⁷ =?= inst✝⁷\n[Meta.synthInstance] ✅️ SMul S (tsze R M) ▶\n[Meta.isDefEq] ✅️ smul =?= smul\n[Meta.synthInstance] ✅️ Module R (tsze R M) ▶\n[Meta.isDefEq] ✅️ module =?= module\n[Meta.synthInstance] ✅️ SMul S R ▶\n[Meta.isDefEq] ✅️ ?m.49 =?= inst✝⁹.toSMul ▶\n[Meta.synthInstance] ✅️ IsScalarTower S R M ▶\n[Meta.isDefEq] ✅️ ?m.50 =?= inst✝⁴ ▶\n[Meta.synthInstance] ❌️ IsScalarTower S R (tsze R M) ▼\n  [] ✅️ new goal IsScalarTower S R (tsze R M) ▶\n  [apply] ❌️ apply st to IsScalarTower S R (tsze R M) ▼\n    [tryResolve] ❌️ IsScalarTower S R (tsze R M) ≟ IsScalarTower S R (tsze R M) ▼\n      [isDefEq] ❌️ IsScalarTower S R (tsze R M) =?= IsScalarTower S R (tsze R M) ▼\n        [] ✅️ S =?= S\n        [] ✅️ R =?= R\n        [] ✅️ tsze R M =?= tsze R M\n        [transparency] raising transparency instances → implicit\n        [] ✅️ inst✝⁹.toSMul =?= inst✝⁹.toSMul\n        [transparency] raising transparency instances → implicit\n        [] ❌️ DistribMulAction.toDistribSMul.toSMul =?= smul ▼\n          [] ❌️ DistribMulAction.toDistribSMul.toSMul =?= Equiv.smul R equivProd ▼\n            [] ❌️ Equiv.smul R equivProd.addEquiv.toEquiv =?= Equiv.smul R equivProd ▼\n              [] ❌️ {\n                    smul := fun n x ↦\n                      equivProd.addEquiv.invFun\n                        (n •&gt;\n                          equivProd.addEquiv.toFun\n                            x) } =?= { smul := fun n x ↦ equivProd.invFun (n •&gt; equivProd.toFun x) } ▼\n                [] ❌️ fun n x ↦\n                      equivProd.addEquiv.invFun\n                        (n •&gt; equivProd.addEquiv.toFun x) =?= fun n x ↦ equivProd.invFun (n •&gt; equivProd.toFun x) ▼\n                  [] ✅️ R =?= R\n                  [] ✅️ tsze R M =?= tsze R M\n                  [] ❌️ equivProd.addEquiv.invFun (n •&gt; equivProd.addEquiv.toFun x) =?= equivProd.invFun (n •&gt; equivProd.toFun x) ▼\n                    [] ❌️ equivProd.addEquiv.toEquiv.2 (n •&gt; equivProd.addEquiv.toFun x) =?= equivProd.2 (n •&gt; equivProd.toFun x) ▼\n                      [] ❌️ equivProd.addEquiv.toEquiv.2 =?= equivProd.2 ▼\n                        [] ❌️ equivProd.addEquiv.toEquiv =?= equivProd ▼\n                          [] ❌️ equivProd.addEquiv.1 =?= equivProd ▼\n                            [onFailure] ❌️ equivProd.addEquiv.1 =?= equivProd\n                        [onFailure] ❌️ equivProd.addEquiv.toEquiv.2 =?= equivProd.2\n                      [onFailure] ❌️ equivProd.addEquiv.toEquiv.2 (n •&gt; equivProd.addEquiv.toFun x) =?= equivProd.2 (n •&gt; equivProd.toFun x)\n                      [onFailure] ❌️ equivProd.addEquiv.toEquiv.2 (n •&gt; equivProd.addEquiv.toFun x) =?= equivProd.2 (n •&gt; equivProd.toFun x)\n                [onFailure] ❌️ {\n                      smul := fun n x ↦\n                        equivProd.addEquiv.invFun\n                          (n •&gt;\n                            equivProd.addEquiv.toFun\n                              x) } =?= { smul := fun n x ↦ equivProd.invFun (n •&gt; equivProd.toFun x) }\n                [onFailure] ❌️ {\n                      smul := fun n x ↦\n                        equivProd.addEquiv.invFun\n                          (n •&gt;\n                            equivProd.addEquiv.toFun\n                              x) } =?= { smul := fun n x ↦ equivProd.invFun (n •&gt; equivProd.toFun x) }\n        [onFailure] ❌️ IsScalarTower S R (tsze R M) =?= IsScalarTower S R (tsze R M)\n        [onFailure] ❌️ IsScalarTower S R (tsze R M) =?= IsScalarTower S R (tsze R M)\n  [apply] ❌️ apply inst✝³ to IsScalarTower S R (tsze R M) ▶\n  [apply] ❌️ apply inst✝⁴ to IsScalarTower S R (tsze R M) ▶\n  [apply] ❌️ apply @IsScalarTower.right to IsScalarTower S R (tsze R M) ▶\n  [apply] ❌️ apply @isScalarTower to IsScalarTower S R (tsze R M) ▶\n  [apply] ❌️ apply IsScalarTower.left to IsScalarTower S R (tsze R M) ▶\n  [apply] ❌️ apply @Semigroup.isScalarTower to IsScalarTower S R (tsze R M) ▶\n  [] result &lt;not-available&gt;\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>So the problem is that <code>equivProd.addEquiv.1 =?= equivProd</code> doesn't work. So we should make some of the declarations here more reducible.</p>",
