        "content": "<p>either that, or fix <code>TrivSqZeroExt.module</code> to not have <code>Equiv.addEquiv</code>, which you can do by putting <code>fast_instance%</code> on <code>TrivSqZeroExt.module</code> and <code>TrivSqZeroExt.distribMulAction</code></p>",
