    {
        "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention silent\" data-user-id=\"816344\">Aaron Liu</span> <a href=\"#narrow/channel/287929-mathlib4/topic/TrivSqZeroExt.20as.20a.202-field.20structure/near/620165444\">said</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>either that, or fix <code>TrivSqZeroExt.module</code> to not have <code>Equiv.addEquiv</code>, which you can do by putting <code>fast_instance%</code> on <code>TrivSqZeroExt.module</code> and <code>TrivSqZeroExt.distribMulAction</code></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>I've gone the <code>fast_instance%</code> route and the basic file now builds. Now, however, I am stuck here in <code>Topology.Instances.TrivSqZeroExt</code>:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">instance</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">T2Space</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">R</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">T2Space</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">M</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">T2Space</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">tsze</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">R</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">M</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">Prod</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">t2Space</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"c1\">-- fails because this is no longer defeq</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>There's no way to transfer <code>T2Space</code> or <code>Continuous</code> across an equivalence. What do I need?</p>",
