    {
        "content": "<p>That one extends Prod rather than writing out the fields</p>",
        "id": 620183698,
        "sender_full_name": "Eric Wieser",
        "timestamp": 1788142718
    },
    {
        "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention silent\" data-user-id=\"310045\">Eric Wieser</span> <a href=\"#narrow/channel/287929-mathlib4/topic/TrivSqZeroExt.20as.20a.202-field.20structure/near/620183663\">said</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Regarding the titular PR, I think we should aim to match <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=Unitization#doc\">docs#Unitization</a>, one way or the other</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>I've done that in the PR, but it doesn't seem to help with <code>Topology.Instances.TrivSqZeroExt</code></p>\n<p>(edit: some progress made, but still no idea how to upgrade the equivalence to a homeomorphism without going through <code>Mathlib.Topology.Homeomorph.TransferInstance</code>)</p>",
        "id": 620193420,
        "sender_full_name": "Jeremy Tan",
        "timestamp": 1788148516
    },
    {
